WEBVTT

00:05.480 --> 00:07.151
I'm sorry.

00:26.980 --> 00:31.162
The lights are dimming in the hall, the shadows

00:31.262 --> 00:35.965
climbing up the wall. We check the dials, turn

00:36.025 --> 00:40.828
the wheel, but there is nothing left to feel. The

00:41.028 --> 00:45.331
engine shudders, then I stops. The pressure in

00:45.391 --> 00:50.093
the chamber drops. It's just a fading spark, a

00:50.174 --> 00:54.266
flicker in the growing dark. We're running out

00:54.306 --> 00:59.149
of time and space Inside this hollow, empty

00:59.289 --> 01:02.611
place The Fading Spot

01:07.793 --> 01:11.976
You search the wiring for a sign You trace the

01:12.076 --> 01:17.420
path of every line The system crashes one by one

01:17.740 --> 01:22.963
Until the work is left undone We build a fortress

01:23.083 --> 01:27.787
way too high And watch the coal owls bleed and die

01:27.847 --> 01:32.540
It's just a fading spark A flicker in the growing

01:32.620 --> 01:38.101
dark We're running out of time and space Inside

01:38.161 --> 01:48.463
this hollow, empty place The fading spot

01:55.805 --> 02:01.682
Is I over? Is I done? Waiting for the fadding sun

02:02.062 --> 02:07.426
No one's left to play the part Hide the secret in

02:07.466 --> 02:11.488
your heart

02:46.356 --> 02:53.798
It's just a fading spark A flicker in the growing

02:53.838 --> 02:59.300
dark We're running out of time and space Inside

02:59.340 --> 03:04.642
this hollow, empty place The fading spark

